{"id":"ecdcf4d005142ad9","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer.md","title":"Transferring a 3SAT Gap to Vertex Cover","display":"prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer — Transferring a 3SAT Gap to Vertex Cover","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer","aliases":["28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer"],"display":"prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer — Transferring a 3SAT Gap to Vertex Cover","depends_on":["[[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §11.4, Corollary 11.17 proof","source_printed_pages":"247–248","source_pdf_pages":"273–274","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer — Transferring a 3SAT Gap to Vertex Cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4088d59cd79fc260\" href=\"?note=4088d59cd79fc260\" title=\"28-lem-clause-assignment-graph\">28-lem-clause-assignment-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §11.4, Corollary 11.17 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"247–248"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"273–274"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4088d59cd79fc260\" href=\"?note=4088d59cd79fc260\" title=\"28-lem-clause-assignment-graph\">28-lem-clause-assignment-graph</a> 的假设，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 为子句数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\Phi=(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi)\">\\(G_\\Phi=(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi)\\)</span> 使用该节点的构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le\\rho&lt;1\">\\(0\\le\\rho&lt;1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 由下式在所有有限简单图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 上定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau(G)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|W|:W\\subseteq V,\\ \\forall e\\in E\\ e\\cap W\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau(G)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|W|:W\\subseteq V,\\ \\forall e\\in E\\ e\\cap W\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau(G_\\Phi)=7m-m\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau(G_\\Phi)=7m-m\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1\\Rightarrow\\tau(G_\\Phi)=6m,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)&lt;\\rho\\Rightarrow\\tau(G_\\Phi)&gt;(7-\\rho)m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1\\Rightarrow\\tau(G_\\Phi)=6m,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)&lt;\\rho\\Rightarrow\\tau(G_\\Phi)&gt;(7-\\rho)m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{6}{7-\\rho}&lt;1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{6}{7-\\rho}&lt;1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>W为顶点覆盖等价于V\\W为独立集，所以τ=|V|−α。代入上游的7m和m val即可。本条记录数值间隙转移本身；最终NP困难性需另以PCP间隙定理为前提，避免把本地等式冒充独立的困难性证明。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.4, Corollary 11.17 proof；印刷页 247–248；PDF 页 273–274。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第11章的 Transferring a 3SAT Gap to Vertex Cover，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-lem-clause-assignment-graph","status":"resolved","id":"4088d59cd79fc260","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-lem-clause-assignment-graph","status":"resolved","id":"4088d59cd79fc260","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi$ 满足 [[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]] 的假设，$m$ 为子句数，$G_\\Phi=(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi)$ 使用该节点的构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\Phi=(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le\\rho<1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(G)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|W|:W\\subseteq V,\\ \\forall e\\in E\\ e\\cap W\\ne\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau(G_\\Phi)=7m-m\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1\\Rightarrow\\tau(G_\\Phi)=6m,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)<\\rho\\Rightarrow\\tau(G_\\Phi)>(7-\\rho)m.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{6}{7-\\rho}<1.","display":true}],"bytes":1875,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-qcsp]]、[[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]]、[[28-prop-independent-set-product]]、[[28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer]]。"}],"outgoing":["4088d59cd79fc260"]}